  "commit_message": "Compare a rubygems source with itself without building its remotes\n\nSpecGroup#merge compares the sources of candidates, which are nearly always the same object, and every comparison built the credential-less remote strings of both sides. This removes about 300,000 allocations from `bundle update` in the large scenario of tool/bench.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
